---
import InfoShell from '../../components/InfoShell.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
---
<InfoShell path="catalogue/" h1="Product catalogue"
  lede="Every Rithwik product in one 7-page A4 PDF (4.5 MB), small enough to forward on WhatsApp.">
  <p><a class="ibtn ibtn--gold" href={`${base}Rithwik-Catalogue.pdf`} download>Download the catalogue (PDF)</a></p>
  <p>The catalogue is made from the same product list as this website, so the two always match. It covers both family businesses: Rithwik Bird Feeds, India's No. 1 foxtail millet supplier, with every bird feed and grade; and Rithwik Industries, with millets, quinoa, chia and other super foods, oil seeds, pulses, spices and cereals. Prices are not printed because they change with the crop: ask on WhatsApp for the day's rate.</p>
  <h2>Inside</h2>
  <ol class="prose">
    <li>Cover: Rithwik Bird Feeds and Rithwik Industries, since 1925</li>
    <li>Who we are: the family story, mission and goal</li>
    <li>Certifications, from field to pack, and where we operate</li>
    <li>Rithwik Industries: millets and super foods</li>
    <li>Rithwik Industries: oil seeds, pulses, spices and cereals</li>
    <li>Rithwik Bird Feeds: every feed and grade</li>
    <li>Contact, with WhatsApp and website QR codes</li>
  </ol>
</InfoShell>
